<p>Hi <%= @user.email %>,</p>

<p>Your one-time login code for <strong><%= @app_name %></strong> is:</p>

<p style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.35em; margin: 20px 0;">
  <%= @otp_code %>
</p>

<p>This code expires in <%= @otp_ttl_minutes %> minutes and can only be used once.</p>

<p>If you did not try to sign in, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
